> - 条件类：奇偶交替着色(odd_even_alternating_color), 含旋转反射变换(includes_rotation_reflection), 非重叠放置(non_overlapping_placement), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 锚点定位复制(anchor_positions_copy), 标记位置接收模板(marker_receive_template), 双面背景处标记(mark_both_bg), 前景不一致处涂色(disagreement_cells_painted), 重叠停止(overlap_stop), 填充位出标记色(filled_gets_marker), 画布裁切可见(canvas_clips_visible), 标记色选邻域几何(marker_color_selects_neighborhood), 含标记涂标记色(marker_presence_color), 归一化形状匹配(normalized_shape_matching), 编码映射(encoding_map), 间距编码尾长(gap_distance_encodes_tail_length), 前景位置放置瓦片(tile_at_foreground_positions), 精灵对准标记复制(sprite_at_marker), 前景数决定排序(fg_count_determines_order), 对角填充(fill_diagonal)
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

